                                    <div class="accordion-body">Guiding candidates every step of the way, Upreak's expert recruiters manage interview scheduling and provide all necessary support to ensure a smooth and efficient experience.</div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="flush-headingFour">
                                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#flush-collapseFour" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="flush-collapseFour">
